OL,3,GNEWSASwinney 'concerned' over Flynn
OL,4,Amissing by-election for World Cup
OL,5,
OL,6,FJohn Swinney was "concerned" that
OL,7,FStephen Flynn was in the US for the
OL,8,FWorld Cup on the day of the Aberdeen
OL,9,FSouth by-election, it has emerged.
OL,11,FFlynn, the SNP's former Westminster
OL,12,Fleader, formally asked to attend the
OL,13,Ftournament on 26 May - less than three
OL,14,Fweeks after he was elected as an MSP.
OL,16,FE-mails released under Freedom of
OL,17,FInformation, first reported by the
OL,18,FDaily Record, show that he intended to
OL,19,Fbe absent from 18 to 27 June with plans
OL,20,Ffor a junior Scottish government
OL,21,Fminister to provide cover.
OL,23,APub: 01-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  Scot NewsC Reg TVF  Weather
FL,424,420,260,160,0,100
